{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56090","headline":"通玄赞八首 五 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"罪福犹镜象，生死若轮回。\n但观明里去，谁识暗中来。\n未慕三天阙，唯愁五苦台。\n罪魂随运尽，幽魄应缘开。\n精气空浮爽，形骸久化灰。\n且甘爲鬼质，谁念入仙胎。\n徒愿青书录，终悲黑簿催。\n法轮难再覩，长夜足堪哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}